  "question": {
    "text": "Two identical metallic spheres <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> when placed at certain distance in air repel each other with a force of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math>. Another identical uncharged sphere <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> is first placed in contact with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and then in contact with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> and finally placed at midpoint between spheres <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>. The force experienced by sphere <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> will be :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>F</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>F</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>F</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let charge on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi></math>.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0118_1b403dd09159.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 75px;\" /></p><p>Then force acting between them is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math>.</p><p>When <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> is placed in contact with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>, charge on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> is placed in contact with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>, charge on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp; and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>q</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now, force experienced by sphere&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0118_a3ae2e6507df.png\" style=\"width: 260px; height: 107px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>F</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>K</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>q</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>-</mo><mi>K</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>q</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>K</mi><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
}